          },
        ],
        "description": "Period comparison (R-06): counts the same filters in a reference period B and reports C (the window), B, C − B, the change in percent and a classification per group. Needs exactly one dataset, from and to, exactly one group_by dimension and top_n ≤ 25.",
      },
      "components": {
        "description": "Only these components (exact names, 1–20). BGL: e.g. KERNEL; OpenStack: e.g. nova-compute.",
